Description: Ultra-modular firewall system for Debian
 Monolith FireWall is a next-generation firewall solution featuring:
 .
  * Ultra-modular design with package system
  * Central configuration management with SQLite
  * Template-driven configuration generation
  * API-first architecture with Named Pipe IPC
  * Modern web UI with Bootstrap 5
  * Command-line management tools
  * pfSense-inspired interface
 .
 This package includes:
  - Core framework with package manager
  - Web UI (accessible on ports 80/443 with SSL)
  - CLI management tool
  - Package manager for installing modules
  - System packages for firewall, NAT, DHCP, DNS, and more
 .
 Note: This package requires .NET 10.0 Runtime to be installed.
 Install it from: https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/10.0
